# Git policy

- After substantive work, commit with a good message
  (Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>).
- **Push after committing.** `origin` is a local mirror on an attached
  drive (`D:/git-mirrors/aibreze.git`).
- **Never publish to npm.** Do not run `npm publish`, `pnpm publish`,
  or `yarn npm publish`. The user publishes.
